  "description": "A powerful Aspect-Oriented Programming (AOP) library for .NET that provides transparent logging of method calls using dynamic proxies. Features real-time dashboard monitoring, database storage with analytics, and zero external dependencies. Supports async methods, custom formatting, configurable log levels, HTTP middleware, and multi-database providers.",
  "id": "Mariodbx.AspectLogging",
